{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by the real history of the Bronze Age Near East, <i>TFC: The Fertile Crescent</i> blends classic base-building RTS gameplay with a fresh, strategic twist.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish your village near fertile land and carefully balance your food surplus against your growing population and army. In TFC, food isn\u2019t just for survival; it fuels growth and technological advancement. A strong surplus accelerates your population growth and earns you Knowledge Points, unlocking new strategic options. But if your farms are raided or your food runs low, even the most powerful economy can collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your hard-earned Knowledge Points wisely. Choose Village Improvements that counter your opponent\u2019s strategy, strengthen your defenses, or push you closer to victory\u2014whether through military conquest or building a Wonder. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Consequential Soil Fertility Mechanic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Food is the foundation of every successful village. Locate fertile ground and build your settlement around it to sustain your growing population. Balancing your food surplus against your villagers and expanding military is crucial, and protecting your farms is key to survival. Conversely, raiding enemy farms is a powerful way to cripple their economy and demoralize their people. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/a17b6f566d4df24159e388143413ff13.poster.avif?t=1765893832\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/a17b6f566d4df24159e388143413ff13.webm?t=1765893832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/a17b6f566d4df24159e388143413ff13.mp4?t=1765893832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Options From The Beginning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the giants of the genre, TFC expands on classic RTS mechanics in innovative ways, offering multiple strategies to explore from the start of each match. With several paths to victory, you can swiftly adapt your strategy in response to enemy actions. Your ability to leverage this freedom will determine whether you face crushing defeat or achieve glorious victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/18ff0108ab0790e3855b4e6b884d2d06.poster.avif?t=1765893832\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/18ff0108ab0790e3855b4e6b884d2d06.webm?t=1765893832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/18ff0108ab0790e3855b4e6b884d2d06.mp4?t=1765893832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Authentic Near East Bronze Age Setting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin settling a small village, where every player starts on equal footing. As your village grows, a pivotal choice awaits: ascend into the Bronze Age and lead one of three legendary civilizations, each with unique strengths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/edd6dff870e64c536b20967058cb790d.poster.avif?t=1765893832\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/edd6dff870e64c536b20967058cb790d.webm?t=1765893832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/edd6dff870e64c536b20967058cb790d.mp4?t=1765893832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Advance Your Village</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your village by unlocking powerful Village Improvements. Spend Knowledge Points to react quickly to enemy tactics, boost your economy, or seize the initiative in battle. Whether you're fortifying your defenses or accelerating your growth, your strategic options are always impactful and easy to execute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/a347b1c22c0cb159d3e551bd0d31ffcf.poster.avif?t=1765893832\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/a347b1c22c0cb159d3e551bd0d31ffcf.webm?t=1765893832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/a347b1c22c0cb159d3e551bd0d31ffcf.mp4?t=1765893832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign</strong> with 10 missions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skirmish</strong> to battle it out against the AI with 4 difficulty levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hordes</strong> to survive the waves of mountain nomads invasions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox\u00a0</strong>to explore the game leisurely without the pressure of mission objectives or enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer </strong> for up to 4 players to challenge other players online on dedicated servers with host migration </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play co-op</strong> by adding bots to online games, or invite a friend to play Hordes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern QoL</strong> like grouping units and customisable hotkeys </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full save and load support</strong> for all single player modes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectate</strong> games in multiplayer </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save, share and load replays</strong> to interactively study matches to learn from the best players, or from your own mistakes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/3909f18767d2d5b0b18aafd4400f47e6.poster.avif?t=1765893832\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/3909f18767d2d5b0b18aafd4400f47e6.webm?t=1765893832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/3909f18767d2d5b0b18aafd4400f47e6.mp4?t=1765893832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginner Turtler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1674820/16b0e13403542ba1144458219586f6747e202d80.jpg"},{"name":"Familiar Turtler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1674820/4a6c4030ecbd7ef6038871a25305c9330ca25abc.jpg"},{"name":"Skilled Turtler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1674820/35b452bba5f80d5f51df58f85133bc96f5154d6a.jpg"},{"name":"Master Turtler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1674820/96a824a01342ae3b186b1a33a7917bd0bbd72743.jpg"},{"name":"Beginner Skirmis