},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by the real history of the Bronze Age Near East, <i>TFC: The Fertile Crescent</i> blends classic base-building RTS gameplay with a fresh, strategic twist.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish your village near fertile land and carefully balance your food surplus against your growing population and army. In TFC, food isn\u2019t just for survival; it fuels growth and technological advancement. A strong surplus accelerates your population growth and earns you Knowledge Points, unlocking new strategic options. But if your farms are raided or your food runs low, even the most powerful economy can collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your hard-earned Knowledge Points wisely. Choose Village Improvements that counter your opponent\u2019s strategy, strengthen your defenses, or push you closer to victory\u2014whether through military conquest or building a Wonder. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Consequential Soil Fertility Mechanic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Food is the foundation of every successful village. Locate fertile ground and build your settlement around it to sustain your growing population. Balancing your food surplus against your villagers and expanding military is crucial, and protecting your farms is key to survival. Conversely, raiding enemy farms is a powerful way to cripple their economy and demoralize their people. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/a17b6f566d4df24159e388143413ff13.poster.avif?t=1765893832\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/a17b6f566d4df24159e388143413ff13.webm?t=1765893832\"