=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/edd6dff870e64c536b20967058cb790d.webm?t=1765893832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/edd6dff870e64c536b20967058cb790d.mp4?t=1765893832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Advance Your Village</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your village by unlocking powerful Village Improvements. Spend Knowledge Points to react quickly to enemy tactics, boost your economy, or seize the initiative in battle. Whether you're fortifying your defenses or accelerating your growth, your strategic options are always impactful and easy to execute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/a347b1c22c0cb159d3e551bd0d31ffcf.poster.avif?t=1765893832\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/a347b1c22c0cb159d3e551bd0d31ffcf.webm?t=1765893832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674820/extras/a347b1c22c0cb159d3e551bd0d31ffcf.mp4?t=1765893832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign</strong> with 10 missions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skirmish</strong> to battle it out against the AI with 4 difficulty levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hordes</strong> to survive the waves of mountain nomads invasions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox\u00a0</strong>to explore the game leisurely without the pressure of mission objectives or enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragrap